# Note nfs4.x was created using:

curl https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-nfsv4-minorversion2-dot-x-38.txt|grep "^  *///" | sed 's?^  */// ??' | sed 's?^  *///$??' >nfs4.1/xdrdef/nfs4.x
patch nfs4.1/xdrdef/nfs4.x <nfs4.1/xdrdef/nfs4.x.diff

The draft was later published as RFC 7863.

Since then, nfs4.x has been edited by hand, and nfs4.x.diff does not
record those edits. Running the commands above produces a file that
lacks them. The hand edits are:

- fattr4_sec_label is no longer an array, to match RFC 7863
  (commit 12115bb8ad0d)
- the Flex Files layout type, from a draft that became RFC 8435
  (commit ab4734fffce8)
- extended attributes, RFC 8276 (commit 43ce9b9589e1)
- the delstid draft (commit 791a45477fbe)
- NOTIFY4_GFLAG_EXTEND (commit 37a2cd525931)

To change nfs4.x, edit it directly.
